        "snippet": "GrowGeneration Corp. (NASDAQ:GRWG) Posts Slight Q1 2026 Earnings Beat Amid Turnaround Efforts | ChartMill.com\n\n### Article Mentions:\n\nGRWG (1.47 ▼ -7.55%)\n\nGrowGeneration Corp. (NASDAQ:GRWG) reported its first-quarter 2026 financial results after the market close on Tuesday, posting results that slightly exceeded analyst expectations on both the top and bottom lines. The hydroponics and cultivation solutions provider saw its shares climb in after-hours trading, reflecting a cautious but positive reception from investors.\n\nThe company reported revenue of $38.39 million for the quarter ended March 31, 2026, marginally above the consensus estimate of $37.18 million. On a non-GAAP basis, the company posted a loss per share of -$0.08, which was slightly better than the -$0.0864 loss analysts had anticipated. These results mark the second consecutive quarter of year-over-year revenue growth for GrowGeneration.\n\n### Recent Performance\n\nGrowGeneration’s first-quarter results highlight a nascen",
